<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech central bank sets 1-wk rev repo at 15.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech central bank sets 1-wk rev repo at 15.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Wednesday set a one week reverse repo tender to drain liquidity from the crown market at a limit rate of 15.2 percent, down from 15.7 percent in a similar operation on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Two bids will be accepted in the American style auction at a minimum of 100 million crowns each.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
